  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-heating\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Heating Services in Greenville, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Residential heating repair, replacement, and installation for homes throughout Greenville, SC.</p>\n<p>When your <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/furnaces\">furnace</a> won&#8217;t start, your <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/heat-pumps\">heat pump</a> loses efficiency, or you&#8217;re ready to replace an aging system, you need heating services in Greenville, SC you can rely on. Carolina Heating Service provides residential heating services — including heating repair, replacement, and heating system installation — for furnaces, heat pumps, <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/geothermal-systems\">geothermal</a> systems, and <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/smart-thermostats\">smart thermostats</a> throughout Greenville, SC and the surrounding Upstate. Certified technicians diagnose the actual problem, walk you through the fix, and get your system running efficiently again.</p>\n<p>Greenville winters bring hard freezes that push heating systems to their limit, and older or poorly maintained equipment often fails right when it&#8217;s needed most. Whether you need heating repair or a full replacement, the right system and regular maintenance make the difference between a heating system that lasts and one that leaves you cold.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: -4px;\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1710\" src=\"/images/2024/04/030624-CHS-37-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Two technicians standing in front of truck\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-gray-light-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /-->\n<div  class=\"services-list container py-5 align-items-left has-background has-gray-light-background-color description-cards align-items-center\" data-layout=\"desc\" data-choose-services=\"subservices\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4 wp-block-heading\">Our Heating Services in Greenville, SC Services</h2>    <!-- multi-component-container /--><div class=\"has-background multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height multi-component-container--4-up\">\n    <div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/furnaces\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"438\" src=\"/images/2024/02/furnaces.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A technician replacing a filter on a gas furnace.\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Furnaces\" aria-label=\"Furnaces\">Furnaces</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Count on our skilled technicians for all your furnace needs. With their expertise and knowledge, they can efficiently diagnose and fix any issues your furnace may have. Your comfort is our priority.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/furnaces\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/geothermal-systems\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Climate-Master-Tranquility-16-Earth-Pure-unit.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Climate Master Tranquility 16 Earth Pure unit\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Geothermal Heat Pump Systems in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Geothermal Heat Pump Systems in Greenville, SC\">Geothermal Heat Pump Systems in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>Our team delivers prompt and efficient geothermal repairs. Rest assured, we can diagnose and fix any issue, ensuring your system operates at peak performance and maintains comfort in your home.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/geothermal-systems\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/heat-pumps\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Mitsubishi-Electric-Heat-Pump-installed-on-the-exterior-of-a-building.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Mitsubishi Electric Heat Pump installed on the exterior of a building\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Heat Pump Systems in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Heat Pump Systems in Greenville, SC\">Heat Pump Systems in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>Trust our technicians to handle your heat pump/air handler repair needs. We diagnose and fix issues promptly, ensuring optimal performance and comfort in your home. Rest easy knowing our experts have you covered.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/heat-pumps\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/smart-thermostats\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Trane-Smart-Thermostat.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Trane Smart Thermostat\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Smart Thermostat Installation in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Smart Thermostat Installation in Greenville, SC\">Smart Thermostat Installation in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>When your smart thermostat needs attention, you can rely on us. Our skilled, friendly technicians are adept at diagnosing issues and providing swift, effective repairs.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-heating/smart-thermostats\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n    </div><!-- ./multi-component-container -->\n</div><!-- ./container -->\n<!-- container /--><div  class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">What Heating Services Involve</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Heating services from Carolina Heating Service cover the full lifecycle of your system: heating repair for immediate problems, heating replacement when a repair no longer makes sense, and heating system installation for new construction or equipment upgrades in Greenville, SC. Furnaces heat air and distribute it through ductwork. Heat pumps and geothermal systems move existing heat rather than generate it, which can lower energy costs. Smart thermostats let you control and schedule your system precisely. Carolina Heating Service installs, repairs, and replaces: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Furnaces, including gas and electric systems</li>\n<li>Geothermal heating systems</li>\n<li>Heat pump systems, including air handlers</li>\n<li>Smart thermostats</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Signs You Need Heating Repair or Replacement</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>A heating system nearing 15 to 20 years old, needing frequent repairs, or struggling to keep up with the thermostat setting is often more expensive to keep repairing than to replace. Rising energy bills without a clear cause, uneven heating between rooms, or a system that&#8217;s louder than it used to be are all signs worth having checked. A technician can inspect your system and quote both heating repair and replacement, so you can compare the real cost of each option before deciding.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Why Choose Carolina Heating Service for Heating Services in Greenville, SC</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Carolina Heating Service has provided residential heating services across Greenville, SC and the Upstate for decades. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Certified technicians: Every technician is trained and certified to work on furnaces, heat pumps, geothermal systems, and smart thermostats.</li>\n<li>Energy-efficiency focus: We help you choose and maintain equipment that lowers energy costs, not just equipment that runs.</li>\n<li>Trained on major manufacturer brands and models: From <a href=\"/maintenance\">routine maintenance</a> to complex repairs, our team is trained to service the equipment already in your home.</li>\n<li>Transparent, customer-focused service: Clear explanations and honest recommendations, not upsells.</li>\n<li>Online scheduling and 24/7 chat: Request service anytime through the Carolina Heating Service website, even outside office hours.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-receipt\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Our Heating Installation and Repair Process</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <ul>\n<li>Contact: Call or schedule online — same-day appointments are available.</li>\n<li>Inspection: A certified technician evaluates your current system or your home&#8217;s heating installation needs.</li>\n<li>Recommendation: You get a clear explanation of the repair, replacement, or installation option, with pricing, before work begins.</li>\n<li>Work: Installation, repair, or replacement is completed by trained technicians using quality parts and equipment.</li>\n<li>Follow-up: Ask about a routine maintenance plan to extend your system&#8217;s life and catch small problems early.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --><!-- buttons/ -->\n        <div class=\"justify-content-center wp-block-group mt-4 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(864) 362-6329</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a></div><!-- ./buttons -->\n     </div><!-- ./container -->\n\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div 