<li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Extend your system’s lifespan through regular maintenance</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Keep you and your family comfortable and safe during all seasons</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div class=\"our-promise container my-5 mt-m-0\" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-reviewing-an-item-on-a-laptop.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two Carolina Heating Service technicians reviewing an item on a laptop\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Heating Services in Greenville and the Surrounding Upstate of South Carolina</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At Carolina Heating Service, we promise heating excellence backed by our team of skilled technicians and top-quality services. Your comfort and satisfaction are our utmost priorities, which is why we offer reliable solutions tailored to meet your specific heating needs. Whether you're facing unexpected breakdowns or planning an upgrade, our experts are dedicated to providing prompt, efficient service that ensures your home stays warm and cozy all winter long. With our commitment to excellence and a customer-centric approach, you can trust Carolina Heating Service to deliver the reliable heating solutions you deserve. Let us help you achieve optimal comfort and peace of mind in your home!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"maintenance-financing\" class=\"container splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2468f3b8 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized has-custom-border w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-performing-maintenance.jpg\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician performing maintenance\" class=\"wp-image-4845\" style=\"border-radius:0px;width:288px;height:auto\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Need a Maintenance Plan?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive With the Carolina Comfort Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-8\">\n<li>15% Off Repair</li>\n\n<li>Heating &amp; Cooling Tune-Up</li>\n\n<li>Reduced Dispatch Fees</li>\n\n<li>Priority Service</li>\n\n<li>Save More with Loyalty Points</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-typ