ad__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Marilyn Jarriel\" aria-label=\"Marilyn Jarriel\">Marilyn Jarriel</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Awesome service! Technician called with arrival time, answered all my questions, replaced the gas pack burners efficiently, and was friendly and professional throughout the entire service call. Very pleased with Carolina Heating Service!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Mark Vogt\" aria-label=\"Mark Vogt\">Mark Vogt</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>These guys have become our Go-To HVAC &amp; Electrical contractors. Always perform outstanding service, quality &amp; support! Techs, Supervisors, &amp; Office personnel are very professional &amp; friendly.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Stephanie Buccolo\" aria-label=\"Stephanie Buccolo\">Stephanie Buccolo</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Furnace stopped working unexpectedly two days before the holiday weekend and Carolina had a tech out right away. Had to order a new blower motor but expedited it and got it installed next day! Excellent communication and a big thanks to the tech who fit me into his already busy schedule.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div>"
